-- a partition import
Adding 5 rows to table db.visible would exceed the row limit (database setting `max_rows`) of 100. (TOO_MANY_ROWS)
-- a table attachment
Adding table `db`.`detached` with 20 rows would exceed the row limit (database setting `max_rows`) of 100. (TOO_MANY_ROWS)
-- a cross-database RENAME
Moving table `db`.`moved` with 7 rows would exceed the row limit (database setting `max_rows`) of 100. (TOO_MANY_ROWS)
-- an insert after the limit is reached
Too many rows in database `db`. The limit (database setting `max_rows`) is set to 100. (TOO_MANY_ROWS)
